              "type": "text",
              "text": "Isabella works a 35-hour week and is paid at an hourly rate of $18.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Any overtime hours worked are paid at time-and-a-half.",
